<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Finance Minister ends budget speech.</title>
<headline>Irish Finance Minister ends budget speech.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Ruairi Quinn sat down in the Dail, Ireland's Parliament, on Wednesday at the conclusion of his 1997 budget speech.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +3531 661 3377</p>
